/-- 35:C17 — the readings of the body's Hamiltonian `(c|p| + σr)/√(ħcσ)` on the declared grid of 600 sites, `E₀ = 2.2320`,
`E₁ = 3.3291` and `C = 3.5003` (the chart's, hypotheses here): for a rational `π'` within `3.1415 < π < 3.1416` the
